```console
$ scherzo-cloud project --help
Manage Scherzo Cloud projects

Usage: scherzo-cloud project [COMMAND]

Commands:
  create       Create a project
  list         List projects
  rename       Rename a project
  repository   Manage a project's repository binding
  runner-pool  Manage a project's runner pool
  show         Show a project
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
